These are your orders. You are to use your stolen APC as cover to infiltrate the Chinese production area, where our sources suggest you will find a Chinese factory producing tanks. Once you have found it, commandeer one of the tanks, bring it back to the portal and return to Ganymede with it. You may have to use your initiative to stay hidden.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Acquire a Chinese tank and return it to Ganymede.
- Stay hidden for as long as possible.